## 12) Definition of Done (Phase 1)
Phase 1 is complete when all of the following are true:
- Input queue finalized as evaluation.in.v1 and configured in Configuration Service.
- Workflow Manager triggers Evaluation Service as phase 4.
- Evaluation Service fetches documentName via Data Interface API GET using executionId.
- Service creates JSON artifact and uploads to S3 via GS Infra SDK.
- Service posts S3 URL to Data Interface API via POST route and confirms database storage.
- Service publishes completion to workflow.response.v1.
- Workflow Manager reads completion and marks workflow as WorkflowCompleted.
- Retry, DLQ, idempotency, and correlation logging are implemented.
- Unit, integration, and one end-to-end validation pass.

## 13) Suggested Implementation Sequence
- Day 1: Configuration and Workflow Manager trigger wiring
- Day 2: Evaluation listener and Data Interface GET integration
- Day 3: JSON generation and GS Infra S3 upload
- Day 4: Data Interface POST for artifact metadata storage
- Day 5: Response publishing, retries, and DLQ
- Day 6: End-to-end validation and production readiness checklist
